            SMART RECIPES
          </h3>
          <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
            Create recipes from anything
          </h4>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Describe a recipe, list ingredients, or import from the web. Lemon calculates the macros for <i>your</i> portion.
          </p>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
